  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.751,
            0.063,
            0.834,
            0.08
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fractions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.12,
            0.833,
            0.16
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "c. 7 rotis divided among 5 children is the same as ____ rotis divided among _____ children."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.22,
            0.159,
            0.334,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{7}{5} = \\frac{ 口 }{ 口 }."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.205,
            0.657,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In which group will each child get more chikki?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.236,
            0.834,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1 chikki divided between 2 children or 5 chikkis divided among 8 children."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.286,
            0.698,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: So, we must compare "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Which is more?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.322,
            0.834,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: Well, we have seen that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\textstyle { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } } \\; = \\; { \\frac { 4 } { 8 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ; and clearly "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 8 } < \\frac { 5 } { 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . So, the children for whom 5 chikkis is divided equally among 8 will get more than those children for whom 1 chikki is divided equally among 2. The children of the second group will get more chikki each."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.455,
            0.833,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What about the following groups? In which group will each child get more?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.51,
            0.833,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1 chikki divided between 2 children or 4 chikkis divided among 7 children."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.562,
            0.833,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: The children of which group will get more chikki this time?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.612,
            0.496,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: We must compare "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{4}{7}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.65,
            0.172,
            0.668
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.67,
            0.311,
            0.7
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 \\times 4 } { 2 \\times 4 } \\; = \\; \\frac { 4 } { 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " so, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\textstyle { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } } \\; = \\; { \\frac { 4 } { 8 } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.712,
            0.833,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: But why did you multiply the numerator and denominator by 4 again?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.765,
            0.333,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: You will see!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.244,
            0.793,
            0.704,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When 4 chikkis are divided equally among 7 children, each one will get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " chikki. When 4 chikkis are divided equally among 8 children, each one will get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " chikki. So "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 4 } { 7 } } > { \\frac { 4 } { 8 } } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
